/P 102 0 R
/E (The Automated Banking System has a wide range of real-world applications in the banking sector. It is mainly used to automate banking transactions such as deposit, withdrawal, balance inquiry, and fund transfer, which helps banks provide faster and more efficient services to customers. This system reduces the burden of manual record keeping and paperwork, thereby minimizing human errors and improving accuracy. It also provides quick access to customer and account details, enabling bank staff to manage customer records easily and respond to customer requests efficiently. Furthermore, the system ensures secure digital storage of banking data and maintains transaction records in an organized manner, which helps in auditing and report generation. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
